values ('f8a9b0c1-2d3e-4f69-8c89-9a0b1c2d3e69', 'natural-science-with-lab', 'Natural Science with Lab', 'Natural Science with Lab is an interdisciplinary first-year laboratory course that introduces students to scientific inquiry through biology, chemistry, physics, and environmental science. Students learn how to ask testable questions, measure carefully, work safely, analyze uncertainty, interpret data, use models, and communicate scientific findings. The course is designed for Liberal Arts students who need a rigorous lab-science foundation without assuming a single major track.');

